cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Koel, please cite it as below."
title: "Koel: an open trust checker for cancer mutation scores"
type: software
authors:
  - alias: notaaaronfr
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-08
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/notaaaronfr/koel"
abstract: >-
  Koel measures how much evidence missense pathogenicity predictors
  (AlphaMissense, ESM1b) provide for somatic oncogenicity, separately for
  oncogenes and tumour suppressors, and maps scores to ClinGen/CGC/VICC
  evidence strengths using openly licensed data only. Research use only.
keywords:
  - cancer genomics
  - variant interpretation
  - oncogenicity
  - AlphaMissense
  - calibration
  - variants of uncertain significance
